            <presentation>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Sales are not subject to VAT, the &quot;Excluding VAT&quot; rate is selected in documents</value>
            </presentation>
            <presentation>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>فروش مشمول مالیات بر ارزش افزوده نیست، نرخ &quot;بدون مالیات بر ارزش افزوده&quot; در اسناد انتخاب شده است</value>
            </presentation>
            <presentation>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Продажа не облагается НДС, в документах выбирается ставка «Без НДС»</value>
            </presentation>
            <presentation>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Satış, KDV'ye tabi değildir; belgelerde &quot;KDV hariç&quot; oranı seçilmektedir</value>
            </presentation>
            <presentation>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Bán hàng không chịu thuế GTGT, trong chứng từ chọn thuế suất &quot;Không thuế GTGT&quot;</value>
            </presentation>
            <presentation>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Sales are not subject to VAT, the &quot;Excluding VAT&quot; rate is selected in documents</value>
            </presentation>
            <presentation>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Sales are not subject to VAT, the &quot;Excluding VAT&quot; rate is selected in documents</value>
            </presentation>
            <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
              <value>Catalog.VATRates.EXCLUDINGVAT</value>
            </value>
          </choiceList>
        </extInfo>
      </items>
